WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.523 --> 00:00:02.123
&gt;&gt; We have an update tonight on

00:00:02.123 --> 00:00:04.725
a story we have been focusing

00:00:04.725 --> 00:00:05.726
on.

00:00:05.726 --> 00:00:08.862
Russia's policy, taking ch

00:00:08.862 --> 00:00:09.863
children, in effect, stealing

00:00:09.863 --> 00:00:11.365
them.

00:00:11.365 --> 00:00:13.367
That is war crime.

00:00:13.367 --> 00:00:15.836
Russia is taking Ukrainian kids,

00:00:15.836 --> 00:00:17.237
in many cases, trying to turn

00:00:17.237 --> 00:00:18.305
them into Russian kids.

00:00:18.305 --> 00:00:20.874
Which they call a humanitarian

00:00:20.874 --> 00:00:22.309
gesture.
We are getting details about

00:00:22.309 --> 00:00:24.745
some video we saw from a rally

00:00:24.745 --> 00:00:28.115
celebrating what Russia calls

00:00:28.115 --> 00:00:29.850
defense of the father day.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.835
There was a 15-year-old girl

00:00:31.835 --> 00:00:32.535
from mariupol.

00:00:32.535 --> 00:00:33.869
On this day, she was made to

00:00:34.288 --> 00:00:35.489
read scripted words of thanks to

00:00:35.897 --> 00:00:40.935
a Russian soldier.

00:00:41.573 --> 00:00:43.575
&gt;&gt; Thank you for safe saving me,

00:00:44.156 --> 00:00:45.558
my sister, and thousands of

00:00:45.973 --> 00:00:54.615
children in mariupol.

00:00:54.615 --> 00:00:57.551
I forget a little.

00:00:57.976 --> 00:01:01.646
&gt;&gt; Don't be shy.

00:01:02.054 --> 00:01:04.123
Everyone give a hug.

00:01:08.543 --> 00:01:08.977
Look.

00:01:08.977 --> 00:01:12.981
It is the man who saved you all.

00:01:13.114 --> 00:01:14.649
&gt;&gt; Not for nothing, his call

00:01:14.983 --> 00:01:16.985
sign is angel.

00:01:17.052 --> 00:01:18.153
&gt;&gt; Well, tonight we know more

00:01:18.286 --> 00:01:22.624
about Anna and her story.

00:01:22.991 --> 00:01:26.995
What have you learned?

00:01:26.995 --> 00:01:28.530
&gt;&gt; Well, that this child,

00:01:28.663 --> 00:01:29.531
Anderson, is several times over

00:01:29.664 --> 00:01:30.532
a victim of this war.

00:01:30.665 --> 00:01:32.267
Not only because, of course, she

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:34.102
lived through the siege of

00:01:34.235 --> 00:01:35.337
mariupol that went on, remember,

00:01:35.470 --> 00:01:37.005
for three long months.

00:01:37.005 --> 00:01:39.174
Sheltering in basements with her

00:01:39.307 --> 00:01:40.575
mother, brother, and sister as

00:01:41.009 --> 00:01:43.011
the city was pounded by heavy

00:01:43.011 --> 00:01:43.378
artillery.

00:01:43.378 --> 00:01:45.013
She then lost her mother, a

00:01:45.013 --> 00:01:47.148
single mother of three who had

00:01:47.282 --> 00:01:48.583
done her best to raise her in

00:01:49.017 --> 00:01:49.584
difficult conditions, as we

00:01:49.718 --> 00:01:50.118
understand.

00:01:50.118 --> 00:01:51.219
As she left the basement one day

00:01:51.353 --> 00:01:56.024
to go out, she was killed.

00:01:56.157 --> 00:01:58.660
Anna has been mourning her ever

00:01:59.027 --> 00:02:00.128
since on-line.

00:02:00.261 --> 00:02:01.329
We are able to see that on

00:02:01.463 --> 00:02:01.930
social media.

00:02:01.930 --> 00:02:03.398
She was taken to Moscow for this

00:02:03.531 --> 00:02:04.466
very public display.

00:02:04.599 --> 00:02:05.934
Not just many the hundreds of

00:02:06.067 --> 00:02:07.135
thousands who were there,

00:02:07.268 --> 00:02:08.103
Anderson, but, of course,

00:02:08.236 --> 00:02:10.105
everyone who saw it aired across

00:02:10.238 --> 00:02:12.173
Russia, but also in Ukraine.

00:02:12.307 --> 00:02:13.608
What we understand since is that

00:02:13.742 --> 00:02:15.677
this child has become abused

00:02:15.810 --> 00:02:18.279
on-line by people angry at what

00:02:18.413 --> 00:02:22.017
they says... What they saw.

00:02:22.150 --> 00:02:23.818
Threatening to hang her.

00:02:23.952 --> 00:02:25.053
It is an extraordinary story of

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:27.055
a child completely unprotected

00:02:27.088 --> 00:02:29.224
and open to very public abuse

00:02:29.357 --> 00:02:31.226
ever since that extraordinary

00:02:31.359 --> 00:02:31.993
spectacle, Anderson.

00:02:32.193 --> 00:02:33.728
&gt;&gt; Were you able to speak with

00:02:33.862 --> 00:02:35.630
people who knew her in Ukraine?

00:02:35.830 --> 00:02:36.231
&gt;&gt; We were.

00:02:36.231 --> 00:02:39.067
We were able to track down and

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:40.402
remember they were talking about

00:02:40.535 --> 00:02:41.169
occupied territories.

00:02:41.302 --> 00:02:42.470
We simply don't have much

00:02:42.604 --> 00:02:43.071
access.

00:02:43.071 --> 00:02:43.772
We did manage to track down a

00:02:43.905 --> 00:02:45.073
couple of people.

00:02:45.073 --> 00:02:46.541
One, a close family member who

00:02:46.675 --> 00:02:47.842
told us more about her sad

00:02:47.976 --> 00:02:49.077
history even before she made it

00:02:49.077 --> 00:02:49.577
to that stage.

00:02:49.711 --> 00:02:51.079
But also a woman who sheltered

00:02:51.146 --> 00:02:52.647
with her for those many weeks in

00:02:53.081 --> 00:02:54.516
the basement, saying, look, she

00:02:54.649 --> 00:02:56.251
was a really nice girl who spent

00:02:56.384 --> 00:02:57.352
time looking after her brother

00:02:57.485 --> 00:02:59.320
and sister and who said she was

00:02:59.454 --> 00:03:00.655
really shocked when she saw that

00:03:01.089 --> 00:03:01.556
video.

00:03:01.556 --> 00:03:03.091
She burst into tears, in fact,

00:03:03.091 --> 00:03:04.693
talking about it, saying, look,

00:03:05.093 --> 00:03:06.261
she may look older than 13.

00:03:06.394 --> 00:03:07.095
This is a child.

00:03:07.228 --> 00:03:08.730
And what's being done to her is

00:03:09.097 --> 00:03:11.800
Tim my completely inhumane,

00:03:11.933 --> 00:03:12.367
Anderson.

00:03:12.367 --> 00:03:15.837
&gt;&gt; I want to bring in Nathaniel

00:03:15.970 --> 00:03:17.706
Raymond.

00:03:17.839 --> 00:03:19.340
The team that produced the

00:03:19.474 --> 00:03:23.111
report.

00:03:23.111 --> 00:03:24.612
First of all, what is your

00:03:24.746 --> 00:03:28.016
reaction to this specific case?

00:03:28.216 --> 00:03:30.518
&gt;&gt; It is absolutely

00:03:30.652 --> 00:03:31.119
stomach-turning.

00:03:31.119 --> 00:03:33.154
Anderson, this is a girl who is

00:03:33.288 --> 00:03:35.457
being used as a prop for

00:03:35.590 --> 00:03:37.959
propaganda, for domestic Russian

00:03:38.226 --> 00:03:39.127
political audience.

00:03:39.127 --> 00:03:41.262
And that is a war crime.

00:03:41.396 --> 00:03:44.332
Underneath the fourth Geneva

00:03:44.799 --> 00:03:45.200
convention.

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:46.301
If use of children as props is a

00:03:46.434 --> 00:03:47.602
violation of their special

00:03:47.736 --> 00:03:49.137
protected status.

00:03:49.270 --> 00:03:50.572
That, for me, Anderson, that is

00:03:50.705 --> 00:03:51.773
a hostage video.

00:03:51.973 --> 00:03:54.075
&gt;&gt; Even if Russia was

00:03:54.209 --> 00:03:55.610
legitimately trying to protect

00:03:55.744 --> 00:04:01.316
children in war Zones, there ar

00:04:01.449 --> 00:04:03.184
are-- there are protocols for

00:04:03.318 --> 00:04:05.153
how children are to be treated.

00:04:05.320 --> 00:04:07.322
&gt;&gt; The Geneva convention,

00:04:07.455 --> 00:04:09.157
basically, a user's manual for

00:04:09.157 --> 00:04:10.125
Russia about how to move kids

00:04:10.258 --> 00:04:11.459
during armed conflict.

00:04:11.593 --> 00:04:12.761
They not only didn't do what's

00:04:13.161 --> 00:04:14.429
in the manual.

00:04:14.562 --> 00:04:16.364
They did opposite day and did

00:04:16.498 --> 00:04:20.635
everything exactly the way they

00:04:20.769 --> 00:04:21.169
shouldn't.

00:04:21.169 --> 00:04:22.203
What does that mean?

00:04:22.337 --> 00:04:23.838
Well, that is a war crime and

00:04:23.972 --> 00:04:25.607
potentially a crime against

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:26.574
humanity.

00:04:26.708 --> 00:04:29.177
As the vice president and the

00:04:29.177 --> 00:04:30.178
secretary of state said in the

00:04:30.311 --> 00:04:30.811
past week.

00:04:31.179 --> 00:04:31.946
&gt;&gt; Why are they doing this?

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:33.515
What are they doing in.

00:04:33.715 --> 00:04:34.582
&gt;&gt; There is three reasons why

00:04:34.716 --> 00:04:35.216
they are doing.

00:04:35.283 --> 00:04:36.351
This one is a broader project

00:04:36.484 --> 00:04:42.490
that they call ruseification.

00:04:42.624 --> 00:04:43.992
They are trying to return

00:04:44.125 --> 00:04:47.629
children from eastern Ukraine

00:04:47.762 --> 00:04:50.165
home as pro-Russian.

00:04:50.365 --> 00:04:52.133
&gt;&gt; They say there is no Ukraine.

00:04:52.267 --> 00:04:55.837
Ukraine has been part of Russia:

00:04:56.037 --> 00:04:56.437
&gt;&gt; Exactly.

00:04:56.437 --> 00:04:57.505
And this is straight out of the

00:04:57.639 --> 00:05:00.008
playbook from cold war soviet

00:05:00.141 --> 00:05:00.842
union days under Stalin.

00:05:01.209 --> 00:05:02.844
They are using many of the same

00:05:03.211 --> 00:05:06.347
facilities from soviet union.

00:05:06.481 --> 00:05:07.448
Political education called the

00:05:07.582 --> 00:05:08.016
pioneer camps.

00:05:08.016 --> 00:05:08.750
The second thing that is going

00:05:08.883 --> 00:05:12.487
on here is really an attempt to

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:14.589
rebrand an invasion that is

00:05:14.722 --> 00:05:15.657
failing.

00:05:15.790 --> 00:05:18.159
And to present to a Russian

00:05:18.293 --> 00:05:20.028
audience, basically, propaganda

00:05:20.161 --> 00:05:21.229
that we are saving these kids

00:05:21.796 --> 00:05:22.664
from purported Nazis.

00:05:22.797 --> 00:05:23.665
The third thing what is

00:05:23.798 --> 00:05:24.833
happening here which for me is

00:05:25.233 --> 00:05:27.268
what keeps me up at night, is

00:05:27.402 --> 00:05:29.237
they are gaining leverage

00:05:29.370 --> 00:05:29.870
potentially.

00:05:29.871 --> 00:05:31.239
You know, people ask me all the

00:05:31.239 --> 00:05:32.173
time, what is the worst thing

00:05:32.307 --> 00:05:34.142
that could happen to Ukraine?

00:05:34.375 --> 00:05:35.910
A nuclear strike?

00:05:36.044 --> 00:05:36.878
Nato intervention?

00:05:37.245 --> 00:05:38.413
&gt;&gt; No.
The worst thing has already

00:05:38.546 --> 00:05:38.913
happened.

00:05:38.913 --> 00:05:40.548
They took the kids.

00:05:40.748 --> 00:05:41.282
&gt;&gt; Melissa, what have you

00:05:41.416 --> 00:05:42.350
learned about these camps where

00:05:42.483 --> 00:05:46.321
these children are being held?

00:05:46.521 --> 00:05:47.255
&gt;&gt; Really harrowing tales that

00:05:47.322 --> 00:05:48.823
we are hearing from parents who

00:05:49.257 --> 00:05:50.024
are desperately trying to find

00:05:50.158 --> 00:05:50.658
their children.

00:05:50.658 --> 00:05:52.760
There is a website that has been

00:05:52.894 --> 00:05:53.661
created here in Ukraine.

00:05:53.795 --> 00:05:54.329
Children of war.

00:05:54.462 --> 00:05:55.730
It is updated daily as parents

00:05:55.864 --> 00:05:57.699
reach out, put pictures of their

00:05:57.832 --> 00:05:58.833
missing children up in the hope

00:05:59.267 --> 00:06:00.168
that somehow they can be found.

00:06:00.301 --> 00:06:01.269
This is extraordinarily

00:06:01.269 --> 00:06:02.403
difficult.

00:06:02.537 --> 00:06:03.705
Getting to the other side of

00:06:03.838 --> 00:06:05.273
that border, finding the

00:06:05.373 --> 00:06:06.908
children to begin with in these

00:06:07.275 --> 00:06:09.277
camps.
Bear in mind, Anderson, a lot of

00:06:09.344 --> 00:06:11.279
these parents, they are the

00:06:11.312 --> 00:06:12.714
children that got lost in the

00:06:12.847 --> 00:06:13.281
war.

00:06:13.281 --> 00:06:14.148
They found themselves on the

00:06:14.282 --> 00:06:15.283
wrong side of the border.

00:06:15.316 --> 00:06:16.251
They were sent to camps or put

00:06:16.384 --> 00:06:17.285
up for adoption.

00:06:17.385 --> 00:06:18.653
There were also children who

00:06:18.786 --> 00:06:22.357
were sent by Ukrainian parents

00:06:22.490 --> 00:06:22.990
in good faith.

00:06:23.291 --> 00:06:24.559
They were encouraged to do so

00:06:24.692 --> 00:06:26.194
because this was a two-week,

00:06:26.327 --> 00:06:29.697
free holiday by the sea

00:06:29.831 --> 00:06:30.198
sometimes.

00:06:30.198 --> 00:06:31.299
They were encouraged to go by

00:06:31.299 --> 00:06:32.533
their teachers, their classmates

00:06:32.667 --> 00:06:33.401
were going.

00:06:33.534 --> 00:06:34.135
Parents thought they were doing

00:06:34.269 --> 00:06:35.403
their children a favor.

00:06:35.536 --> 00:06:36.704
Send them off to these camps and

00:06:36.838 --> 00:06:38.907
haven't heard from them since or

00:06:39.307 --> 00:06:40.208
if they have been lucky enough

00:06:40.341 --> 00:06:41.409
to hear from them, haven't been

00:06:41.542 --> 00:06:42.644
able to get them back.

00:06:42.777 --> 00:06:43.945
Once they are there and we know

00:06:44.279 --> 00:06:45.780
a bit about what goes on with

00:06:45.914 --> 00:06:49.317
them, but also because Russia

00:06:49.450 --> 00:06:51.853
makes no secret of this,

00:06:51.986 --> 00:06:52.486
Anderson.

00:06:52.520 --> 00:06:53.454
They publicize these videos

00:06:53.588 --> 00:06:54.889
showing what goes on in these

00:06:55.323 --> 00:06:57.325
The kind of activities you would
camps.

00:06:57.325 --> 00:06:58.626
expect in a normal summer camp

00:06:58.760 --> 00:07:00.695
but also Russian language

00:07:00.828 --> 00:07:01.329
lessons.

00:07:01.329 --> 00:07:02.563
The teaching of the Russian

00:07:02.697 --> 00:07:03.331
national anthem.

00:07:03.331 --> 00:07:04.766
The singing daily of the Russian

00:07:05.333 --> 00:07:05.967
national anthem.

00:07:06.167 --> 00:07:06.534
&gt;&gt; Right.

00:07:06.534 --> 00:07:08.703
It is indoctrination.

00:07:08.903 --> 00:07:11.339
&gt;&gt; The revised history they are

00:07:11.339 --> 00:07:13.341
forced into.

00:07:13.341 --> 00:07:15.343
&gt;&gt; Have you seen anything like

00:07:15.343 --> 00:07:16.678
this?
&gt;&gt; This has been the most

00:07:16.811 --> 00:07:18.079
overwhelming immediate response

00:07:18.212 --> 00:07:20.181
to human rights reporting that I

00:07:20.315 --> 00:07:21.349
have either seen or been

00:07:21.349 --> 00:07:21.916
involved in.

00:07:22.050 --> 00:07:23.484
Since the report has come out,

00:07:23.618 --> 00:07:26.220
we have had statements from the

00:07:26.354 --> 00:07:27.755
president, from other senior

00:07:27.889 --> 00:07:28.256
officials.

00:07:28.256 --> 00:07:29.924
But we have had sanctions on

00:07:30.058 --> 00:07:30.825
four of the officials in our

00:07:30.959 --> 00:07:31.359
report.

00:07:31.359 --> 00:07:32.593
By the United States and three

00:07:32.727 --> 00:07:33.928
from the European union.

00:07:34.062 --> 00:07:35.363
For me, the response which has

00:07:35.363 --> 00:07:36.864
been most telling is what's come

00:07:36.998 --> 00:07:37.999
out of the Kremlin.

00:07:38.132 --> 00:07:39.434
They have doubled down on this

00:07:39.567 --> 00:07:40.067
program.

